    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προήγορ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορά</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who speaks in behalf of</i> others, <i>defender,
